{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"Malathor's eyes glimmer at the question, he leans towards you as the shadows around him seem to darken, a phantom wind swirls around him, disturbing the fog around you and blowing his robes. \"I have whispered in the ears of many in my time, but never has the wind whispered in mine own ears my young friend. Also, head pigeons, an unfortunate condition, I hope you make a full recovery.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T02:42:12.036000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863973490709364756","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"\"I think they've infested my ship.\"\n\nI look around the street, then step a bit closer to Malathor, seeking his shadow. I open my hand and conjure a gust of wind in my palm. \"I have these, powers. I cannot always remember where I . . . where. Where they came from? But I am connected to the wind.\"\n\n\"*It is in my breath*.\" I say in Primordial.\n\nMy voice lowers to a whisper. \"So. For the wind. To speak to me today . . .\" I pause, eyes fixed far away.\n\n\"We had a drink together.\" I say, suddenly laughing.","created_at":"2021-07-12T02:47:57.322000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863974938943946772","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"For a moment it seemed I was about to ask the old man another question, but now the spell is broken. \"Perhaps I should go.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T02:49:24.012000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863975302547898389","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"Malathor laughs with you, a wheezing, echoing sound like glass grinding on slate, placing a wrinkled hand on your shoulder and patting you. \n\"Mmm, business to attend to elsewhere friend? I say it has been a pleasure conversing with you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T02:50:56.816000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863975691794776095","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"\"Pleasure. Yes. The pleasure is mine. I . . . May I - that is to say - is there somewhere I may call upon. You? Mister Malathor, I wonder?\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T02:53:09.460000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863976248145477652","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"\"Oh, I am always around this time of day, somewhere or other, I tend to wander on evening strolls, yes I'm quite busy throughout the day you see, as I mentioned I'm on leave from my home, I have business that has kept me here longer than I had hoped... *But it looks like things might be turning around soon.*\" Malathor says stroking his chin and staring off into the fog.","created_at":"2021-07-12T02:56:12.331000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863977015162306590","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
